  "description": "SmartFileKit is a lightweight, high-performance .NET library for secure file validation, file security, and advanced file analysis.\n\n      It provides file signature (magic byte) verification, MIME type detection, file classification, cryptographic hashing (MD5, SHA1, SHA256, SHA512), duplicate file detection, and file fingerprinting for reliable file identity.\n\n      The library includes an enterprise-grade file analysis engine with risk scoring, threat detection, polyglot file detection, entropy analysis, and structural validation for Office documents (DOCX, XLSX, PPTX) and archive files (ZIP).\n\n      Designed for secure file upload scenarios, SmartFileKit also provides a fluent validation API, upload policy engine, filename sanitization, and protection against common file-based attacks such as extension spoofing, double extensions, and path traversal.\n\n      Built with zero external dependencies and optimized for performance, it is ideal for ASP.NET Core applications, enterprise systems, and high-scale file processing pipelines.",
